{"id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-kleene-equality.md","title":"Kleene Equality of Partial Values","display":"df-kleene-equality — Kleene Equality of Partial Values","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-kleene-equality","aliases":["88-df-kleene-equality"],"display":"df-kleene-equality — Kleene Equality of Partial Values","depends_on":["[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-kleene-equality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-kleene-equality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-equality — Kleene Equality of Partial Values"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (partial function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,C,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,C,B)\\)</span> (partial function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in C\">\\(y\\in C\\)</span> (inputs)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\simeq g(y)\">\\(f(x)\\simeq g(y)\\)</span> (Kleene equality of partial values)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}equality} \\vdash\nf(x)\\simeq g(y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,C,B)\n\\land x\\in A\\land y\\in C\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl(\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\n\\land y\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\land f(x)=g(y)\n\\Bigr)\n\\lor\n\\Bigl(\nx\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}equality} \\vdash\nf(x)\\simeq g(y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,C,B)\n\\land x\\in A\\land y\\in C\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl(\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\n\\land y\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\land f(x)=g(y)\n\\Bigr)\n\\lor\n\\Bigl(\nx\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> agrees with ordinary equality when both values are defined and also identifies joint divergence.</li>\n<li>It is not the structure-isomorphism symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_S\">\\(\\cong_S\\)</span> from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56d4bb42ba99a0b1\" href=\"?note=56d4bb42ba99a0b1\" title=\"88-df-isomorphism\">88-df-isomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li>输入类型属于定义本身；因此对域外记号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(y)\">\\(g(y)\\)</span>不赋予伪“共同发散”值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)$ (partial function, see [[88-df-partial-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,C,B)$ (partial function, see [[88-df-partial-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"56d4bb42ba99a0b1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"It is not the structure-isomorphism symbol $\\cong_S$ from [[88-df-isomorphism]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,C,B)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)\\simeq g(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}equality} \\vdash\nf(x)\\simeq g(y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,C,B)\n\\land x\\in A\\land y\\in C\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl(\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\n\\land y\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\land f(x)=g(y)\n\\Bigr)\n\\lor\n\\Bigl(\nx\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_S","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"g(y)","display":false}],"bytes":1294,"backlinks":[{"id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 见 [[88-df-partial-function]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_k$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。"},{"id":"92178dc88a5e0bd4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\simeq$ (Kleene equality, see [[88-df-kleene-equality]])"},{"id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。"},{"id":"96267a91020ab600","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。"},{"id":"b5ecdf917f015f32","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"部分函数按 [[88-df-partial-function]] 解释为图；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。"},{"id":"7fea1eb1680edf84","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\simeq$ (Kleene equality, see [[88-df-kleene-equality]])"},{"id":"f29bba901d666547","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\simeq$ (Kleene equality of partial values, see [[88-df-kleene-equality]])"},{"id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s)$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-equality]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formu